 ("Which areas do you cover?","Wesley Chapel, Land O' Lakes, Lutz, Zephyrhills, San Antonio, New Tampa, Tampa, Carrollwood, Brandon and Riverview, plus the rest of Pasco and northern Hillsborough County. If you manage a property nearby, ask."),
